# Normalize line endings across platforms.
#
# The Python scripts under skills/ppt-master-sci/scripts/ carry shebangs and are
# meant to be runnable on Unix, so they must keep LF. Forcing LF repo-wide also
# stops CRLF churn from showing up as spurious diffs in Markdown and JSON.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
